-- LEVEL-OFF radar (CASE I TOWER, replaces the COMMENCING table): side profile
-- of the 700-1600 ft band — the commence→break descent gap + the 1200 ft SPIN
-- pattern.  X = range from Mother (0..4 nm), Y = altitude; reference lines at
-- 1.5k (band top), 1.2k (spin), 800 (pattern).  Hook plots dots + modex.
